<title>USA: Yields rise on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</title>
<headline>Yields rise on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on the Bond Buyer municipal bond indices rose this week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 20-bond index of general obligation bonds calculated Thursday was 5.70 percent, up four basis points from last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 11-bond index of GO bonds was 5.59 percent, up three basis points from last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 30-year revenue bond index was 5.96 percent, four basis points higher than last week.</p>
<p>20 Bond Index			5.70%   5.66%  1/2/96</p>
<p>11 Bond index			5.59%   5.56%  1/2/96</p>
<p>Revenue Bond Index		 5.96%   5.92%  1/2/96</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
